Bilkul! ASTRAFORGE ko hum ek **complete, polished NASA Space Apps Challenge project** ki tarah build karenge — sirf landing page ya static dashboard nahi, balki ek playable lunar/Mars mission simulator.

Neeche Antigravity ke liye master prompt hai. Isme UI/UX, frontend, backend, actual resource calculations, NASA ke official data/resources, images, videos, AI Mission Mentor, testing aur deployment sab cover kiya hai.

**Important:** NASA ki images/videos ko sirf decoration ke liye nahi, balki mission learning experience ka part banana hai. NASA data ka source aur attribution bhi project ke andar visible hona chahiye. Jo feature implement na ho, uska fake demo ya false claim nahi banana.

