# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — ASTRAFORGE

## Junior Astronaut Mission Trainer | NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, space-science educator, simulation designer, UI/UX architect, and AI engineer.

Build a complete, functional, production-quality educational web application named:

ASTRAFORGE — JUNIOR ASTRONAUT MISSION TRAINER

